        List of issue dictionaries matching all specified filters.
        Each dictionary contains: id, title, description, status, tags,
        created_at, updated_at.
    
    Example:
        >>> search_issues(store, query="bug login", tags=["auth"], status="open")
        [{'id': '...', 'title': 'Bug in login', ...}]
    """
